  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Fund to Fight AIDS TB and Malaria Core Contributions for Financial Years 2023-24 to 2025-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding contributions to the Global Fund to Fight AIDS TB and Malaria for financial years 2023-24 to 2025-26. This investment contributes to Australia&apos;s pledge of $266 million to the 7th replenishment of the Global Fund. The total value of this investment is $239.4 million and covers Australia&apos;s core funding contribution.  This funding is pooled with other donor core contributions. Its utilisation is overseen by the Global Fund Board on which Australia is represented. The remaining $26.6 million of Australia&apos;s pledge is managed by DFAT in support of Global Fund objectives in the Indo Pacific, under INO390.</narrative>
  </description>
